{"id":"umofmorh","ord":"a3","title":"roadmap/performance.olai"}
{"id":"performance","parent":"umofmorh","ord":"a0","title":"Performance","desc":"Opened 2026-08-19 on the human's ruling, from the PR #258 search-complexity question.\n\n- **Ruling:** when olai supports large vaults, the hot paths must not be LINEAR in vault size — indices are maintained iteratively (pay O(change) per edit), never recomputed per event.\n- Children are the known O(n)-per-event costs, each filed with what event pays and what it scales with.","created":"2026-08-19T16:46:59-04:00","changed":"2026-08-19T19:10:00-04:00"}
{"id":"fphyhg5h","ord":"a4","title":"roadmap/bugs.olai"}
{"id":"bugs","parent":"fphyhg5h","ord":"a0","title":"Bugs","doing":true,"desc":"Known defects, each carrying its diagnosis; per HACKING.md every fix ships with a test that reproduces it."}
